# ==============================================================================
# CENDARO ERP — Ironclad Open Source .gitignore
# ==============================================================================

# ── 1. Referencias Externas & Diseños Específicos ────────────────────────────
*midday*
*Midday*

# ── 2. Documentación Interna, Auditorías, PRDs, ADRs & Planes Locales ────────
# Se expone públicamente únicamente `docs/assets/` (logos y capturas del README).
# PRDs, ADRs, arquitectura, runbooks internos, auditorías y planes quedan en local.
docs/*
!docs/assets/
!docs/assets/**
plans/
/PRODUCT.md
/DESIGN.md
/setup.ps1

# ── 3. Memoria Operativa, Skills, Hooks & Configuraciones de Agentes IA ──────
.opencode/
claude_code_implementation_plan
.gemini/
.ops/
graphify-out/
.agents/
.claude/
.codex/
.impeccable/
apps/erp/.impeccable/
.cursor/
.cursorrules
.windsurfrules
.claudeignore
.graphifyignore
/AGENTS.md
/CLAUDE.md
/GEMINI.md
apps/erp/AGENTS.md
apps/erp/CLAUDE.md

# ── 4. Almacén Binario de Paquetes & Gestores de Dependencias ────────────────
.pnpm-store/
node_modules/
.pnpm-debug.log*

# ── 5. Entorno, Secretos, Llaves, Certificados & Dumps de BD (Ironclad) ──────
# Ignora absolutamente todo .env, llaves privadas y volcados SQL locales,
# permitiendo únicamente la plantilla pública `.env.example`.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.crt
*.jks
*.keystore
*.dump
*.bak
*.sql.gz
.vercel/
supabase/.branches/
supabase/.temp/

# ── 6. Salidas de Compilación, Cachés, Bytecode & Bundles ────────────────────
dist/
.next/
.turbo/
.cache/
scripts/landing-media/.cache/
out/
design-system/
*.tsbuildinfo
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.ruff_cache/

# ── 7. Logs, Depuración & Diagnósticos ───────────────────────────────────────
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# ── 8. Cobertura de Pruebas, Reportes & Artefactos de Automatización ─────────
coverage/
.nyc_output/
*.lcov
test-results/
playwright-report/
blob-report/
--full-page
apps/erp/--full-page

# ── 9. Seguridad, Notarización Local & Sentry ────────────────────────────────
.sentryclirc
# AgentShield evidence bundles are generated for a specific audit and can
# contain local paths; the baseline and its README are versioned, they are not.
.agentshield/evidence/
agentshield.sarif
audit-merkle-proof*.json

# ── 10. Service Workers & PWA ────────────────────────────────────────────────
sw.js
workbox-*.js

# ── 11. Entorno de Desarrollo (IDEs), Temporales & Sistema Operativo ─────────
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/settings.json
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*.iml

# OS Metadata & Temp Files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
*~
*.tmp
*.temp

# Crash dumps (Git Bash / MSYS2 on Windows)
*.stackdump
